This licence covers the code in this repository. It does not cover the data
the pipeline downloads or the artefacts built from it, which carry their own
terms:

  Crime records        City of Los Angeles, under the LA Open Data terms
  Street network       OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0
  Streetlights         City of Los Angeles Bureau of Street Lighting
  School directory     California Department of Education
  Transit schedules    LA Metro GTFS
  Basemap tiles        CARTO
  Leaflet 1.9.4        BSD-2-Clause, vendored under vendor/leaflet/

data/graph.bin is derived from OpenStreetMap geometry and is therefore subject
to the ODbL's share-alike terms.
